      "text": "This guide is the theoretical spine of the Sentinel triad. Where `03-CONSENSUS.md` covers Paxos, Raft, and Zab at the protocol level, this guide goes underneath: the impossibility results that bound what any protocol can achieve, the Byzantine fault model that bridges into security engineering, and the formal safety/liveness arguments that separate correct protocols from plausible-looking broken ones."
